      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual and textual elements of the meme, specifically the exhausted goats and the text 'mohammed is very tired', implying that the user identifies with or is humorously likened to the person named 'Mohammed' who is depicted as very tired. This projection is indirect, through the analogical mapping of the goats' state to the named individual, without explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you'.",
